{"_id":"68a7361e8ec3d8323af18231","nodeId":"O29VoTfPiU8GZ_c16ZJIp","roadmapSlug":"golang","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:09.800Z","description":"# goto (discouraged)\n\nGo includes `goto` statement but discourages its use. Can only jump to labels within same function. Creates unstructured code flow making programs hard to read, debug, and maintain. Use structured control flow (loops, functions, conditionals) instead. Rarely needed in modern Go programming.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Label scopes","url":"https://go.dev/ref/spec#Label_scopes","_id":"6a26767c7e97c9d3f8b8d8a8"},{"type":"official","title":"Goto statements","url":"https://go.dev/ref/spec#Goto_statements","_id":"6a26767c7e97c9d3f8b8d8a9"},{"type":"article","title":"Goto Statement Usage","url":"https://labex.io/tutorials/go-goto-statement-usage-149074","_id":"6a26767c7e97c9d3f8b8d8aa"},{"type":"article","title":"GoLang ΓÇö Jumping in the code using goto","url":"https://medium.com/@rajasoni1995/golang-jumping-in-the-code-using-goto-a36116831396","_id":"6a26767c7e97c9d3f8b8d8ab"},{"type":"article","title":"Goto Hell With Labels in Golang","url":"https://programmingpercy.tech/blog/goto-hell-with-labels-in-golang/","_id":"6a26767c7e97c9d3f8b8d8ac"}],"updatedAt":"2026-06-08T07:59:56.882Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/golang/content/O29VoTfPiU8GZ_c16ZJIp.md"}